{%- comment -%}
  cc-story-apr26 — Our Story
  Extracted from cc-homepage.liquid (Apr 26 rebuild, vanilla re-scope)
{%- endcomment -%}

{% render 'cc-deps' %}

<div class="cc-apr26 cc-story-apr26">
    <section class="bg-parchment reveal" style="padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:80px;" x-intersect.once="$el.classList.add('visible')">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-8 lg:px-16 text-center">
        <span style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B6B6B;display:block;margin-bottom:20px;">OUR STORY</span>
        <div style="width:60px;height:1px;background:#E8E8E8;margin:0 auto 40px;"></div>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:500;color:#0A0A0A;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-0.02em;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);margin-bottom:32px;">Built by dads looking<br>for an easier way.</h2>
        <div style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:16px;color:#6B6B6B;line-height:1.75;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 40px;text-align:left;">
          <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">We were four dads overwhelmed by the supplement aisle. Hundreds of bottles, contradicting claims, no way to know what actually worked. So we partnered with four leading experts to build a system based on real clinical data, dosed at clinically-verified amounts.</p>
          <p>Thirteen ingredients. Nothing speculative, no filler, no fads. Just the most science-backed compounds for longevity &mdash; timed to your biology and delivered in a system you will actually stick with.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;">
          <img src="{{ 'cc-v8-founder-portrait.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Chris Booth, Co-Founder" style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;" loading="lazy">
          <p style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:#0A0A0A;margin:0;">Chris Booth</p>
          <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:12px;color:#6B6B6B;margin:0;">Co-Founder, Coastline Longevity</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
</div>

